cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use the recorded results, please cite the technical report."
title: "olmoearth_inferenceX research record"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Qi
    given-names: Ziming
date-released: 2026-10-27
license: Apache-2.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/2imi9/olmoearth_inferenceX-record"
abstract: >-
  The experiments, committed artifacts, claim ledger and technical report behind olmoearth-inferencex up to 1.20.1.
  The checks run against 1.12.1, the release the earlier experiments ran on; the later experiments' checks read only
  their committed outputs. The methods are evaluated on the 24 tasks of Ai2's published embedding suite across 16
  encoders, on fully labelled real maps and on two agencies' published reference samples; each recorded result is
  linked to a committed artifact and re-checked against it by the test suite.
preferred-citation:
